# Secrets — REQ-N3, CLAUDE.md rule 9. Never commit a real .env.
# Ignore every .env variant, then allow back only the committed templates,
# which contain no values. A denylist of specific names misses the next one
# somebody creates — and .env.test already held a real SESSION_SECRET.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test.example

# Local uploads. Product photos go to object storage in deployment (D-3);
# this directory only exists so PB-10 has somewhere to write during development.
apps/api/.uploads/
packages/db/src/generated/
